---A table containing result names and amounts. Products also contain information such as fluid temperature, probability of results and whether some of the amount is ignored by productivity.
---
---Can be set to an empty table to create a recipe that produces nothing. [Assembling machines](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/AssemblingMachinePrototype.html%23max_item_product_count#max_item_product_count) do not support recipes with more than 65 535 different item products.
---
---Duplicate results, e.g. two entries with the same name, are allowed.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RecipePrototype.html%23results#results)
---@field results? (ProductPrototype)[]
---@
---
---When set to `true`, item ingredients will be sorted based on [ItemGroup::order\_in\_recipe](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/ItemGroup.html%23order_in_recipe#order_in_recipe).
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RecipePrototype.html%23sort_item_ingredients#sort_item_ingredients)
---@field sort_item_ingredients? boolean
---@
